# W31h, b (k10): stays in stag0201 when a and c go into dng204b1; goes along 30 s after the notice (their floor is ready:
# stamped at once); the test hook makes their floor busy 40 s right after the stamp: b's GO barrier waits past
# Instances:JoinHoldSeconds (30 s) without a new stage group at dng204b1; after the 10 s line ("Waiting for ...'s
# floor...") and 22 s more (32 s into the barrier, before the scene's end at about 37 s), B: Back to the lobby takes b
# home. (The waits on the loading screen count the wall clock, waited: no step runs there, so frames do not; the host runs
# the script there too, run c1 never got the goback.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@900
log b sees the notice
idle until frames>=1800 fail stagechange
goalong until go=stamped or go=going
log b goes along
idle until goback=1 fail stage=dng204b1,epoch>=@1100
log b's barrier waits for the busy floor
idle until waited>=22 fail stage=dng204b1
log b waited past the join hold
goback until stage=stagml11,control fail stage=dng204b1,frames>=1800
log b back in the lobby
idle until frames>=120
